Subject: [PATCH] fix(plugins): publish name-scoped Kanban pure validation API
 [daveey]

Three existing pure validators are required by dashboard pre-write validation; prior direct imports failed the zero-baseline plugin boundary. Publish only selector, text and review validation, not allocation or mutation. Creator decision09:33 approves this narrow public contract; independent API-choice review remains required before landing. Proof: contract RED25/1, boundary/API/dashboard GREEN173/0 with retries disabled, mixed requests preserve row and event history.
